# Prisma migration files are checksummed by exact file content (including
# line endings) the moment they're applied. This repo's local git config
# commonly has core.autocrlf=true, which otherwise silently rewrites LF to
# CRLF on every checkout/branch-switch — causing the exact checksum-mismatch
# incident recorded in docs/DECISION_LOG.md, twice. Force LF, unconditionally,
# for every migration file, overriding any user-level autocrlf setting.
prisma/migrations/**/*.sql text eol=lf

# Reasonable repo-wide defaults so this class of bug doesn't resurface
# elsewhere. Avoid touching binary-ish or generated files.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
